# GeoHub is a single-page app. There is deliberately no top-level 404.html,
# so Cloudflare Pages serves index.html for every path without a file and the
# app's router takes over — including every old page URL ("/profile.html?id=…",
# "/feed", "/business.html?id=…"), which web/src/legacy.js rewrites to its new
# place.
#
# Do not add rules of the form "/foo /foo.html": Cloudflare 301s /foo.html to
# /foo, so such a rule loops forever. No rules are needed here at present.
